n / Assumptions Audit — Session 36 (post Slice-A F1)#Ranked findings (highest headline-risk first)#F2 — Slot-density (333) vs billing-density (167) divergence is a silent calibration commitment. **[HIGH, SILENT]**#{1}":[58,63],"#Calibration / Assumptions Audit — Session 36 (post Slice-A F1)#Ranked findings (highest headline-risk first)#F2 — Slot-density (333) vs billing-density (167) divergence is a silent calibration commitment. **[HIGH, SILENT]**#{2}":[64,64],"#Calibration / Assumptions Audit — Session 36 (post Slice-A F1)#Ranked findings (highest headline-risk first)#F2 — Slot-density (333) vs billing-density (167) divergence is a silent calibration commitment. **[HIGH, SILENT]**#{3}":[65,66],"#Calibration / Assumptions Audit — Session 36 (post Slice-A F1)#Ranked findings (highest headline-risk first)#F2 — Slot-density (333) vs billing-density (167) divergence is a silent calibration commitment. **[HIGH, SILENT]**#{4}":[67,85],"#Calibration / Assumptions Audit — Session 36 (post Slice-A F1)#Ranked findings (highest headline-risk first)#F3 — The κ→regime spot-price map is the dominant $ knob and is **not yet built**, so currently unfalsifiable by omission. **[HIGH, UNFALSIFIABLE / UNBUILT]**":[86,104],"#Calibration / Assumptions Audit — Session 36 (post Slice-A F1)#Ranked findings (highest headline-risk first)#F3 — The κ→regime spot-price map is the dominant $ knob and is **not yet built**, so currently unfalsifiable by omission. **[HIGH, UNFALSIFIABLE / UNBUILT]**#{1}":[87,104],"#Calibration / Assumptions Audit — Session 36 (post Slice-A F1)#Ranked findings (highest headline-risk first)#F4 — The fallback dominance factor (2.0 here vs 1.5 in §13) is a live spec/code drift that conditions L2_fallback-avoidance. **[MED, SILENT DRIFT]**":[105,115],"#Calibration / Assumptions Audit — Session 36 (post Slice-A F1)#Ranked findings (highest headline-risk first)#F4 — The fallback dominance factor (2.0 here vs 1.5 in §13) is a live spec/code drift that conditions L2_fallback-avoidance. **[MED, SILENT DRIFT]**#{1}":[106,115],"#Calibration / Assumptions Audit — Session 36 (post Slice-A F1)#Ranked findings (highest headline-risk first)#F5 — Book-lead B mean/spread (48 ± 24h) is the λ axis's calibration and is silently fixed in shape. **[MED]**":[116,128],"#Calibration / Assumptions Audit — Session 36 (post Slice-A F1)#Ranked findings (highest headline-risk first)#F5 — Book-lead B mean/spread (48 ± 24h) is the λ axis's calibration and is silently fixed in shape. **[MED]**#{1}":[117,128],"#Calibration / Assumptions Audit — Session 36 (post Slice-A F1)#Ranked findings (highest headline-risk first)#F6 — Tier-coupled book-lead means (12/48/96h) are a load-bearing empirical claim, correctly demoted to upper-bracket. **[MED, HONESTLY HANDLED]**":[129,135],"#Calibration / Assumptions Audit — Session 36 (post Slice-A F1)#Ranked findings (highest headline-risk first)#F6 — Tier-coupled book-lead means (12/48/96h) are a load-bearing empirical claim, correctly demoted to upper-bracket. **[MED, HONESTLY HANDLED]**#{1}":[130,135],"#Calibration / Assumptions Audit — Session 36 (post Slice-A F1)#Ranked findings (highest headline-risk first)#F7 — Tier mix 20/40/40 swept; SLA offsets and θ_flex silently fixed. **[MED]**":[136,147],"#Calibration / Assumptions Audit — Session 36 (post Slice-A F1)#Ranked findings (highest headline-risk first)#F7 — Tier mix 20/40/40 swept; SLA offsets and θ_flex silently fixed. **[MED]**#{1}":[137,147],"#Calibration / Assumptions Audit — Session 36 (post Slice-A F1)#Ranked findings (highest headline-risk first)#F8 — Cargo weight triangular(50,1200,300) and density uniform(120,240) jointly set E[SE_k] and the whole supply scale. **[MED→HIGH coupling]**":[148,163],"#Calibration / Assumptions Audit — Session 36 (post Slice-A F1)#Ranked findings (highest headline-risk first)#F8 — Cargo weight triangular(50,1200,300) and density uniform(120,240) jointly set E[SE_k] and the whole supply scale. **[MED→HIGH coupling]**#{1}":[149,163],"#Calibration / Assumptions Audit — Session 36 (post Slice-A F1)#Ranked findings (highest headline-risk first)#F9 — `n_hawbs` fixed-N (D-A8) is an L2-deflating simplification, acknowledged. **[LOW]**":[164,169],"#Calibration / Assumptions Audit — Session 36 (post Slice-A F1)#Ranked findings (highest headline-risk first)#F9 — `n_hawbs` fixed-N (D-A8) is an L2-deflating simplification, acknowledged. **[LOW]**#{1}":[165,169],"#Calibration / Assumptions Audit — Session 36 (post Slice-A F1)#Ranked findings (highest headline-risk first)#F10 — Static .tex calibration constants (`V_ref=$10k`, `w_p`, customs/handling costs). **[LOW for L2]**":[170,180],"#Calibration / Assumptions Audit — Session 36 (post Slice-A F1)#Ranked findings (highest headline-risk first)#F10 — Static .tex calibration constants (`V_ref=$10k`, `w_p`, customs/handling costs). **[LOW for L2]**#{1}":[171,180],"#Calibration / Assumptions Audit — Session 36 (post Slice-A F1)#Honest accounting: swept vs silently-fixed":[181,206],"#Calibration / Assumptions Audit — Session 36 (post Slice-A F1)#Honest accounting: swept vs silently-fixed#{1}":[183,206],"#Calibration / Assumptions Audit — Session 36 (post Slice-A F1)#Calibration-note must-pin-down checklist (free sources only)":[207,228],"#Calibration / Assumptions Audit — Session 36 (post Slice-A F1)#Calibration-note must-pin-down checklist (free sources only)#{1}":[209,228],"#Calibration / Assumptions Audit — Session 36 (post Slice-A F1)#The single most important thing to pin before the (κ,α,λ) sweep is trusted":[229,241],"#Calibration / Assumptions Audit — Session 36 (post Slice-A F1)#The single most important thing to pin before the (κ,α,λ) sweep is trusted#{1}":[231,241]},"outlinks":[],"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:01-Projects/ai-freight-agent/docs/critique/14-calibration-audit-s36.md#Calibration / Assumptions Audit — Session 36 (post Slice-A F1)": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":"10sfbop","at":1781400026740},"embeddings":